{"id":"3d8d8d77bc6b39e2","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-switching-restriction.md","title":"Random Restriction","display":"df-switching-restriction — Random Restriction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-switching-restriction","aliases":["28-df-switching-restriction","Random Restriction"],"display":"df-switching-restriction — Random Restriction","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §14.1.1 and Lemma 14.2; independent-retention variant supplied locally","source_printed_pages":"287–289","source_pdf_pages":"313–315","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-switching-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-switching-restriction</span><span>Random Restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-switching-restriction — Random Restriction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §14.1.1 and Lemma 14.2; independent-retention variant supplied locally"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"287–289"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"313–315"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\{0,1,*\\}^n\">\\(\\rho\\in\\{0,1,*\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[0,1]\">\\(p\\in[0,1]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\{0,1,*\\}^n\">\\(A\\subseteq\\{0,1,*\\}^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_p,\\mathcal R_{n,t}\">\\(\\mathcal R_p,\\mathcal R_{n,t}\\)</span> 是该有限集合上的概率测度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\rho\">\\(J_\\rho\\)</span> 为未赋值坐标集合；受限函数使用以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\rho\">\\(J_\\rho\\)</span> 为指标的赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z:J_\\rho\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(z:J_\\rho\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_\\rho\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:\\rho_i=*\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{ext}_\\rho(z)_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\rho_i&amp;i\\notin J_\\rho,\\\\z(i)&amp;i\\in J_\\rho.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_\\rho\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:\\rho_i=*\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{ext}_\\rho(z)_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\rho_i&amp;i\\notin J_\\rho,\\\\z(i)&amp;i\\in J_\\rho.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\upharpoonright\\rho:\\{0,1\\}^{J_\\rho}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad (f\\upharpoonright\\rho)(z)\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{ext}_\\rho(z)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\upharpoonright\\rho:\\{0,1\\}^{J_\\rho}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad (f\\upharpoonright\\rho)(z)\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{ext}_\\rho(z)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_p(*)\\coloneqq p,\\quad w_p(0)=w_p(1)\\coloneqq(1-p)/2,\\qquad \\mathcal R_p(A)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\rho\\in A}\\prod_{i=1}^n w_p(\\rho_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_p(*)\\coloneqq p,\\quad w_p(0)=w_p(1)\\coloneqq(1-p)/2,\\qquad \\mathcal R_p(A)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\rho\\in A}\\prod_{i=1}^n w_p(\\rho_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{n,t}(A)\\coloneqq\\binom nt^{-1}2^{-t}\\left|\\{\\rho\\in A:|[n]\\setminus J_\\rho|=t\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_{n,t}(A)\\coloneqq\\binom nt^{-1}2^{-t}\\left|\\{\\rho\\in A:|[n]\\setminus J_\\rho|=t\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>乘积质量函数直接表达坐标独立。书中 Lemma 14.2 使用恰好固定 t 个变量的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{n,t}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{n,t}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_p\">\\(\\mathcal R_p\\)</span> 是常用的独立保留变体，两者没有被等同。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§14.1.1 and Lemma 14.2; independent-retention variant supplied locally，印刷页 287–289；PDF 页 313–315。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\{0,1,*\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\{0,1,*\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_p,\\mathcal R_{n,t}","display":false},{"tex":"J_\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"J_\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"z:J_\\rho\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"J_\\rho\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:\\rho_i=*\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{ext}_\\rho(z)_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\rho_i&i\\notin J_\\rho,\\\\z(i)&i\\in J_\\rho.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\upharpoonright\\rho:\\{0,1\\}^{J_\\rho}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad (f\\upharpoonright\\rho)(z)\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{ext}_\\rho(z)).","display":true},{"tex":"w_p(*)\\coloneqq p,\\quad w_p(0)=w_p(1)\\coloneqq(1-p)/2,\\qquad \\mathcal R_p(A)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\rho\\in A}\\prod_{i=1}^n w_p(\\rho_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{n,t}(A)\\coloneqq\\binom nt^{-1}2^{-t}\\left|\\{\\rho\\in A:|[n]\\setminus J_\\rho|=t\\}\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{n,t}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_p","display":false}],"bytes":1943,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"下界工具：[[28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound]]、[[28-df-switching-restriction]]、[[28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}